Error [E0102]: `Arena` has no method `free`
  --> tests/ui/mem_allocator_free_retired.jet:5:11
    |
  5 |     arena.free()
    |           ^^^^
 Why: allocator terminal release uses the same nominal `Close` protocol as every resource; it consumes through the move marker `^`
 Fix: write `close(^allocator)` with the move marker `^`; use `allocator.reset()` only when reusing its backing storage
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0102

Error [E0102]: `Arena` has no method `free`
  --> tests/ui/mem_allocator_free_retired.jet:5:11
    |
